    <briefdescription>
<para>Utility class for dispatching events to specific handlers. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classEventDispatcher" kindref="compound">EventDispatcher</ref> allows type-safe event handling by checking the event type and casting to the appropriate derived class before invoking the callback.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This is a lightweight wrapper; for global event handling, use <ref refid="classEventBus" kindref="compound">EventBus</ref>. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classEventBus" kindref="compound">EventBus</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
